    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the prologue of My Sexy Neighbor 2 \u2014 the forbidden origin story where everything begins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBefore the fans, before the fame, and before the full-on madness, there was just you \u2014 a bored nobody with a camera, a dirty mind, and a thirst for something more. What started as a joke \u2014 a few dares, a few sneaky clips \u2014 is about to spiral into something wild.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udc40 Peep into lives behind closed doors.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udeaa Test your limits with petty break-ins and first risky stunts.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfa5 Discover the thrill of being watched \u2014 and paid for it.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcac Meet the first voices of your future fanbase: hungry, twisted, and very generous.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udca6 And yes \u2014 expect things to get hot. Very hot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfae What\u2019s in the prologue:<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf03 First missions \u2014 low stakes, high tension.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Basic tools and dirty tricks.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udd1e Softcore mischief meets hardcore curiosity.<br />\r\n\ud83d\udcbb A peek into the dark web future.<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Open world with real-time flow \u2014 do what you want, when you want.<br />\r\n\ud83e\udde0 NPCs live their own lives \u2014 watch, follow, interfere... or seduce.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f What happens next?<br />\r\nThat\u2019s up to you. But this is where it all starts \u2014 with one bad decision that feels way too good.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour story\u2019s about to go viral.<br />\r\nReady to hit \u201crecord\u201d?",
